OL,3,GNEWSAPolice officer facing 14 charges
OL,4,Aincluding three alleged rapes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police officer is to stand trial
OL,7,Fcharged with raping two women and
OL,8,Fsexually assaulting three others.
OL,10,FTrevor McConnachie, 32, faces a total
OL,11,Fof 14 charges spanning between March
OL,12,F2023 and April 2026.
OL,14,FThe alleged offences are said to have
OL,15,Foccurred in a number of locations
OL,16,Fincluding Aberdeen, Perth, and his home
OL,17,Ftown of Wick.
OL,19,FLawyer Kris Gilmartin, defending, pled
OL,20,Fnot guilty on behalf of McConnachie at
OL,21,Fa hearing in the High Court in Glasgow.
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
